"native term metadata og samtidighedstokens uden at afsløre postindhold."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:23
msgid "Read posts in a Series"
msgstr "Læs indlæg i en Serie"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:23
msgid ""
"List readable posts with their native part numbers, pending order, status "
"and date. Pagination filters unreadable objects first. Get-post-series "
"supplies edit tokens for individual posts."
msgstr ""
"Liste læsbare indlæg med deres native delnumre, ventende rækkefølge, status "
"og dato. Pagineringsfiltre uleselige objekter først. Get-post-series "
"leverer redigerings tokens for individuelle indlæg."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:24
msgid "Inspect a Series or category"
msgstr "Inspekter en Serie eller kategori"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:24
msgid ""
"Read name, description, icon, order, category assignments and "
"expected_hash. Series Categories use taxonomy=category. Parent IDs apply to "
"hierarchical categories."
msgstr ""
"Læs navn, beskrivelse, ikon, rækkefølge, kategori tildelinger og "
"expected_hash. Series Kategorier bruger taxonomy=category. Forældre-ID'er "
"gælder for hierarkiske kategorier."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:25
msgid "Create or update a Series or category"
msgstr "Opret eller opdater en Serie eller kategori"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:25
msgid ""
"Create with name, or patch an existing id and expected_hash. Omitted fields "
"remain unchanged. icon_id is a readable image attachment; zero clears the "
"Series icon. category_ids replace Series category assignments; [] clears "
"them. dry_run previews."
msgstr ""
"Opret med navn, eller patch et eksisterende id og expected_hash. Udeladte "
"felter forbliver uændrede. icon_id er en læsbar billedvedhæftning; nul "
"fjerner Series ikonet. category_ids erstatter Series kategori tildelinger; "
"[] fjerner dem. dry_run forhåndsvisninger."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:26
msgid "Delete a Series or category"
msgstr "Slet en Serie eller kategori"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:26
msgid ""
"Delete a native taxonomy term without deleting its posts. Requires the "
"current term and membership token and permission to edit all affected "
"posts. dry_run previews. Large collections remain in native administration."
msgstr ""
"Slet en native taxonomi term uden at slette dens indlæg. Kræver den "
"aktuelle term og medlemskabs token samt tilladelse til at redigere alle "
"berørte indlæg. dry_run forhåndsvisninger. Store samlinger forbliver i "
"native administration."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:27
msgid "Inspect a post’s Series and block assignments"
msgstr "Inspekter et indlægs Series og blok tildelinger"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:27
msgid ""
"Read Series membership, part numbers, widget short title and Series "
"Gutenberg block attributes for a readable editable supported post. Returns "
"expected_hash covering affected Series order and content."
msgstr ""
"Læs Series medlemskab, delnumre, widget kort titel og Series Gutenberg blok "
"attributter for et læsbart redigerbart understøttet indlæg. Returnerer "
"expected_hash der dækker berørte Series rækkefølge og indhold."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:28
msgid "Set post Series, part numbers and widget title"
msgstr "Indstil indlæg Series, delnumre og widget titel"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:28
msgid ""
"Replace memberships with items; [] removes all. Omit items to update only "
"short_title. Part zero uses native automatic placement. Multiple Series "
"requires active Pro Multiple Series. All posts whose numbering can change "
"require native read/edit permission. Read expected_hash from get-series "
"before adding a new membership. dry_run previews."
msgstr ""
"Erstat medlemskaber med elementer; [] fjerner alle. Udelad elementer for "
"kun at opdatere short_title. Del nul bruger native automatisk placering. "
"Flere Series kræver aktiv Pro Flere Series. Alle indlæg, hvis nummerering "
"kan ændre sig, kræver native læse/redigere tilladelse. Læs expected_hash "
"fra get-series før du tilføjer et nyt medlemskab. dry_run forhåndsvisninger."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:31
msgid "Update Series memberships for multiple posts"
msgstr "Opdater Serie medlemskaber for flere indlæg"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:31
msgid ""
"Validate every explicit post, Series token and native permission before "
"updating up to 20 posts. Each row uses the same input as "
"update-post-series. Omitted fields are preserved. dry_run previews all "
"rows. Native numbering is not transactional; inspect complete, applied_ids "
"and failed_id before retrying a partial result."
msgstr ""
"Valider hvert eksplicit indlæg, Serie-token og native tilladelse før "
"opdatering af op til 20 indlæg. Hver række bruger den samme input som "
"update-post-series. Udeladte felter bevares. dry_run viser alle rækker. "
"Native nummerering er ikke transaktionel; inspicer komplet, applied_ids og "
"failed_id før genforsøg af et delvist resultat."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:32
msgid "Order, publish, schedule or unpublish Series posts"
msgstr "Bestil, offentliggør, planlæg eller fjern offentliggørelsen af Serie indlæg"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:32
msgid ""
"Native Series Order and Publish Series workflows. Get expected_hash from "
"get-series. order requires the complete counted post set and never "
"publishes drafts. pending-order requires complete unpublished set. publish "
"accepts selected pending/draft posts; date is optional site-local "
"YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM for scheduling. unpublish affects the entire Series. trash "
"requires explicit post_ids and native deletion capabilities. mark-published "
"changes only the Series marker. date-asc/date-desc reuse native "
"publication-date ordering. Cross-Series status transitions require "
"series_tokens from get-series for the other memberships. sync-menu-order "
"copies part numbers to WordPress menu order. All affected objects are "
"preflighted; native multi-step operations are not transactional. dry_run "
"previews."
msgstr ""
"Native Serie bestilling og offentliggørelsesarbejdsgange. Få expected_hash "
"fra get-series. bestilling kræver det komplette optalte indlægssæt og "
"offentliggør aldrig udkast. pending-order kræver komplet uoffentliggjort "
"sæt. offentliggør accepterer udvalgte ventende/udkast indlæg; dato er "
"valgfri site-lokal YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM til planlægning. fjern offentliggørelse "
"påvirker hele Serien. skrald kræver eksplicit post_ids og native "
"sletningsmuligheder. mark-published ændrer kun Serie-markøren. "
"date-asc/date-desc genbruger native publiceringsdato sortering. "
"Cross-Series statusovergange kræver series_tokens fra get-series for de "
"andre medlemskaber. sync-menu-order kopierer delnumre til WordPress menu "
"rækkefølge. Alle berørte objekter er preflighted; native multi-trins "
"operationer er ikke transaktionelle. dry_run viser."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:33
msgid "Add or configure a Series Gutenberg block"
msgstr "Tilføj eller konfigurer en Serie Gutenberg blok"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Content.php:33
msgid ""
"Append a native Series block or update one using its zero-based path from "
"get-post-series. Only registered Series block attributes are accepted, with "
"native editor availability and layout access checks. No arbitrary HTML or "
"other block edits. dry_run previews."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj en native Serie blok eller opdater en ved hjælp af dens nul-baserede "
"sti fra get-post-series. Kun registrerede Serie blokattributter accepteres, "
"med native editor tilgængelighed og layout adgangskontrol. Ingen vilkårlig "
"HTML eller andre blokredigeringer. dry_run viser."

