msgstr "Læs den aktuelle Serie blok sti før redigering."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:79
msgid "Read Series layout fields and settings"
msgstr "Læs Serie layoutfelter og indstillinger"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:79
msgid ""
"Inspect a Post List Box, Post Details or Post Navigation layout. Omit id to "
"discover native fields/defaults for a new layout. Includes exact JSON "
"schema, native labels and edition locks. Use list-layouts to find IDs."
msgstr ""
"Inspicer en Post Liste Boks, Post Detaljer eller Post Navigation layout. "
"Udelad id for at opdage native felter/standarder for et nyt layout. "
"Inkluderer nøjagtig JSON skema, native etiketter og redigeringslås. Brug "
"liste-layouts til at finde ID'er."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:80
msgid "Find Series layouts"
msgstr "Find Serie layouts"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:80
msgid "List readable native Series layouts, including trash when requested."
msgstr "Liste læsbare native Serie layouts, inklusive skrald når det anmodes om."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:88
msgid "Create or update a Series layout"
msgstr "Opret eller opdater et Serie layout"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:88
msgid ""
"Create a published layout or patch one by id and expected_hash. Use "
"get-layout for exact per-module field types and locks. JSON booleans for "
"checkboxes, integers for sizes and image IDs, strings for select choices. "
"Omitted fields and unrelated metadata remain unchanged. dry_run previews."
msgstr ""
"Opret et offentliggjort layout eller patch et ved id og expected_hash. Brug "
"get-layout for nøjagtige pr-modul felt typer og låse. JSON booleans for "
"afkrydsningsfelter, heltal for størrelser og billede ID'er, strenge for "
"valgmuligheder. Udeladte felter og ikke-relateret metadata forbliver "
"uændrede. dry_run viser."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:89
msgid "Trash, restore or delete a Series layout"
msgstr "Skrald, gendan eller slet et Serie layout"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:89
msgid ""
"Native layout lifecycle. Read id and expected_hash first. Permanent "
"deletion requires prior trash and native delete permission. dry_run "
"previews."
msgstr ""
"Native layout livscyklus. Læs id og expected_hash først. Permanent sletning "
"kræver forudgående skrald og native slette tilladelse. dry_run viser."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:124
msgid "Use native administration for more than 1,000 layouts."
msgstr "Brug native administration til mere end 1.000 layouts."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:148
msgid "Supply a title for the new layout."
msgstr "Angiv en titel for det nye layout."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:154
msgid "Restore the layout before editing."
msgstr "Gendan layoutet før redigering."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:167
msgid "This layout field requires an active Pro feature."
msgstr "Dette layoutfelt kræver en aktiv Pro-funktion."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:205
msgid ""
"The layout exists but its settings were not fully confirmed. Read before "
"retrying."
msgstr ""
"Layoutet eksisterer, men dets indstillinger blev ikke fuldt bekræftet. Læs "
"før du prøver igen."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Layouts.php:223
msgid "This lifecycle operation does not match the current layout state."
msgstr ""
