"retrying; some changes may have been saved."
msgstr ""
"Series kunne ikke fuldføre denne operation. Inspicer den nuværende tilstand "
"før du prøver igen; nogle ændringer kan være blevet gemt."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Registry.php:200
msgid "This object changed. Read it again before saving."
msgstr "Dette objekt er blevet ændret. Læs det igen før du gemmer."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Registry.php:205
msgid ""
"The operation could not be fully confirmed. Read the object before "
"retrying; some changes may have been saved."
msgstr ""
"Operationen kunne ikke bekræftes fuldt ud. Læs objektet før du prøver igen; "
"nogle ændringer kan være blevet gemt."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Settings.php:79
msgid "Read Series settings and choices"
msgstr "Læs Series-indstillinger og valg"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Settings.php:79
msgid ""
"Discover native Series Settings: automatic displays, layouts, legacy "
"templates, category archives, metabox, sorting, uninstall policy and active "
"Pro features. Booleans use JSON true/false; layout IDs are integers. No "
"license or account credentials are returned."
msgstr ""
"Opdag native Series-indstillinger: automatiske visninger, layouts, legacy "
"skabeloner, kategoriarkiver, metabox, sortering, afinstallationspolitik og "
"aktive Pro-funktioner. Booleans bruger JSON true/false; layout-ID'er er "
"heltal. Ingen licens- eller kontooplysninger returneres."

#: includes-core/Mcp/Settings.php:80
msgid "Update Series settings"
msgstr "Opdater Series-indstillinger"

#: includes-core/Mcp/Settings.php:80
msgid ""
"Patch the exact keys discovered by get-plugin-settings. Preserve omitted "
"settings. Read expected_hash first. dry_run previews without saving. Pro "
"addon and post-type changes take effect on the next request. Taxonomy "
"identity migrations remain in native administration."
msgstr ""
"Patch de nøjagtige nøgler, der er opdaget af get-plugin-settings. Bevar "
"udeladte indstillinger. Læs expected_hash først. dry_run viser uden at "
"gemme. Pro-addon- og post-type-ændringer træder i kraft ved næste "
"anmodning. Taxonomi identitetsmigrationer forbliver i native administration."

